From: marvinli00 <marvinli0327@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 11:30:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] cloud-config: env overrides for bundle base URL and disabling
 fetch

Add two environment variables read only by the cloud config bundle loader:

- CODEX_CLOUD_CONFIG_BASE_URL_OVERRIDE: base URL used for the bundle
  request instead of chatgpt_base_url. Other ChatGPT backend traffic is
  unaffected.
- CODEX_CLOUD_CONFIG_DISABLED=1|true: skip the bundle fetch entirely and
  apply no workspace-managed config or requirements (rollout kill switch).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RTzRQNC4dSSKtEWxNhw7mH
